Resume a paused integration

Usage: vendo integrations resume [OPTIONS] <integrationId>

Arguments:
  <integrationId>  

Options:
      --json            Output raw JSON
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
      --dry-run         Preview the action without executing
      --output <field>  Print a single field (e.g. id)
  -h, --help            Print help

Examples:
  $ vendo integrations resume <integrationId>
  $ vendo integrations resume <integrationId> --dry-run
